micropython-font-to-py - Font Conversion Tools for MicroPython
================================================================

This project uses the micropython-font-to-py toolset for converting TrueType
fonts to MicroPython-compatible Python modules.

Source: https://github.com/peterhinch/micropython-font-to-py
License: MIT License (see below)

Copyright Notice:
-----------------
Copyright (c) 2016 Peter Hinch

Files/Tools Used:
-----------------
- lib/writer.py (text rendering library, copied during build)
- tools/micropython-font-to-py/font_to_py.py (font conversion tool, used during build)

Used By:
--------
- src/main.py (imports Writer for rendering text on e-ink display)
- Makefile (prepare and fonts targets use font_to_py.py to generate font files)

Generated Font Files:
---------------------
- lib/fonts/font*.py (all fonts in lib/fonts/ are generated by font_to_py.py)

